{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>SuperColony</strong>, the captivating ant colony simulation game inspired by the intricate behaviors of insects and the best elements of RTS and Colony-Simulation games. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage the Colony and Grow your Empire:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Direct your ants through the world using pheromone markers, guiding them with war, scouting, and harvest pheromones. Watch as your entire colony responds to your commands with complex behaviors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/9babbeebdc364002c1df2bd4aea7f07c.poster.avif?t=1759534149\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/9babbeebdc364002c1df2bd4aea7f07c.webm?t=1759534149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/9babbeebdc364002c1df2bd4aea7f07c.mp4?t=1759534149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight Insects and Unlock Genetic Abilities:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest resources and genetic abilities from defeated insects. Learn to fly like Ladybugs or spin webs from Arachnids, but be prepared for challenging battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/4282add7ee24843be862e9a8e3d3046b.poster.avif?t=1759534149\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/4282add7ee24843be862e9a8e3d3046b.webm?t=1759534149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/4282add7ee24843be862e9a8e3d3046b.mp4?t=1759534149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evolve and Customize Your Ant Colony:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect DNA points from the environment to unlock genes and evolve your ants into specialized castes. Experiment with unique abilities like flying, web-slinging, and explosions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/92ebde36393a397b1109518de7d8a936.poster.avif?t=1759534149\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/92ebde36393a397b1109518de7d8a936.webm?t=1759534149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/92ebde36393a397b1109518de7d8a936.mp4?t=1759534149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Gene Tree as you Find New Genes in the World:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 6 parts on each ant, the number of potential combinations for building new ant castes is vast. Try different combinations for different situations and strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/6b4e575c78188f9831d78885b23f3602.poster.avif?t=1759534149\" width=600 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/6b4e575c78188f9831d78885b23f3602.webm?t=1759534149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/6b4e575c78188f9831d78885b23f3602.mp4?t=1759534149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thrive in a Dynamic Environment:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions impact the world; killing all the Ladybugs may unleash chaos with the Aphids. Explore, adapt, and learn from your surroundings to thrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/6761747fd42f59014cf14b9dee0e75a1.poster.avif?t=1759534149\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/6761747fd42f59014cf14b9dee0e75a1.webm?t=1759534149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/6761747fd42f59014cf14b9dee0e75a1.mp4?t=1759534149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate goal is to create new queens with valuable genes, expanding your ant societies and advancing toward building a global SuperColony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the adventure in SuperColony today and experience the fascinating world of ants!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1815650?t=1759534149","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1815650?t=1759534149","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/eba0a91bf6342fba63b30fc4e6b9f65c8c5e2bb1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759534149","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/eba0a91bf6342fba63b30fc4e6b9f65c8c5e2bb1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759534149","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>SuperColony</strong>, the captivating ant colony simulation game inspired by the intricate behaviors of insects and the best elements of RTS and Colony-Simulation games. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage the Colony and Grow your Empire:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Direct your ants through the world using pheromone markers, guiding them with war, scouting, and harvest pheromones. Watch as your entire colony responds to your commands with complex behaviors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/9babbeebdc364002c1df2bd4aea7f07c.poster.avif?t=1759534149\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/9babbeebdc364002c1df2bd4aea7f07c.webm?t=1759534149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/9babbeebdc364002c1df2bd4aea7f07c.mp4?t=1759534149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight Insects and Unlock Genetic Abilities:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest resources and genetic abilities from defeated insects. Learn to fly like Ladybugs or spin webs from Arachnids, but be prepared for challenging battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/4282add7ee24843be862e9a8e3d3046b.poster.avif?t=1759534149\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/4282add7ee24843be862e9a8e3d3046b.webm?t=1759534149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/4282add7ee24843be862e9a8e3d3046b.mp4?t=1759534149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evolve and Customize Your Ant Colony:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect DNA points from the environment to unlock genes and evolve your ants into specialized castes. Experiment with unique abilities like flying, web-slinging, and explosions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/92ebde36393a397b1109518de7d8a936.poster.avif?t=1759534149\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/92ebde36393a397b1109518de7d8a936.webm?t=1759534149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/92ebde36393a397b1109518de7d8a936.mp4?t=1759534149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Gene Tree as you Find New Genes in the World:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 6 parts on each ant, the number of potential combinations for building new ant castes is vast. Try different combinations for different situations and strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/6b4e575c78188f9831d78885b23f3602.poster.avif?t=1759534149\" width=600 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/6b4e575c78188f9831d78885b23f3602.webm?t=1759534149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/6b4e575c78188f9831d78885b23f3602.mp4?t=1759534149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thrive in a Dynamic Environment:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions impact the world; killing all the Ladybugs may unleash chaos with the Aphids. Explore, adapt, and learn from your surroundings to thrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/6761747fd42f59014cf14b9dee0e75a1.poster.avif?t=1759534149\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/6761747fd42f59014cf14b9dee0e75a1.webm?t=1759534149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/6761747fd42f59014cf14b9dee0e75a1.mp4?t=1759534149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate goal is to create new queens with valuable genes, expanding your ant societies and advancing toward building a global SuperColony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the adventure in SuperColony today and experience the fascinating world of ants!</p>","developers":["Antic Games Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/02deea62a8c70c48f3a0a3b6cd43645fee223bca/header.jpg?t=1759534149","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2-core 1.7 GHz or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon Pro 560X or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4-core 2.9 GHz or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon Pro 5500 XT or eGPU<br></li><li><