 hostile world of insects. Fight for resources, build underground networks, learn from the environment, harvest DNA from defeated foes, evolve new ant abilities, and guide hundreds of ants toward building a global SuperColony. Add to Wishlist now!","steam_appid":1815650,"support_info":{"email":"info@anticgames.ca","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America","type":"game","website":"https://www.supercolonygame.com/"}